# deskloop - Live Video Wallpaper Engine for macOS

When asked to set, change, or manage desktop video wallpapers on macOS:

1. Applying Wallpapers:
   - Run in the background without blocking the terminal using `--daemon`:
     `deskloop run <path|url> --daemon`
   - Local files: `deskloop run ~/Movies/wallpaper.mp4 --daemon`
   - Video URLs: `deskloop run "https://example.com/loop.mp4" --daemon`

2. Status and Control:
   - Check status: `deskloop status --json`
   - Stop playback: `deskloop stop --json`
